fonts-ocr-b (0.2~dfsg1-4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Bump Build-Depends on fontforge to force building
    with the newest version.
    Building the package succeeds with older fontforge versions as well,
    but then some of the glyphs end up malformed.
  * Bump debhelper compat to 10.

 -- Fabian Greffrath <fabian@debian.org>  Sun, 13 Nov 2016 17:41:48 +0100

